- **Model too permissive:**  
  The model allows requests to be processed without an audit trail of who approved or denied them.

#### Fix:

**Add a fact to enforce audit trail linkage:**
```alloy
fact ProcessedRequestsMustHaveAudit {
  all r: Request | some r.processedIn => some r.approvedOrDeniedBy
}
```
Place this fact near the other request-processing facts.

